    {
      "id": "mathematics-02-012",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "A bag contains coins of ₹1, 50p, 25p in ratio 2:3:4. Total value is ₹180. Number of 50p coins?",
      "options": {
        "A": "120",
        "B": "150",
        "C": "90",
        "D": "200"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Value Ratio: 2 : 1.5 : 1. Total 4.5 units = 180. 1 unit = 40. 50p coins = 3 × 40 = 120.",
      "hash": "6c31dfb2f34b3317",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक बैग में ₹1, 50 पैसे और 25 पैसे के सिक्के 2:3:4 के अनुपात में हैं। यदि कुल मूल्य ₹180 है, तो 50 पैसे के सिक्कों की संख्या क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "120",
            "B": "150",
            "C": "90",
            "D": "200"
          },
          "explanation": "मूल्य अनुपात: 2(1) : 3(0.5) : 4(0.25) = 2 : 1.5 : 1. कुल = 4.5 इकाई = 180. 1 इकाई = 40. 50 पैसे के सिक्के = 3 × 40 = 120."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-02-013",
      "number": 13,
      "question": "A boat moves at 6 km/hr in still water. It takes thrice as much time to go upstream as downstream. Find stream speed.",
      "options": {
        "A": "3 km/hr",
        "B": "2 km/hr",
        "C": "4 km/hr",
        "D": "2.5 km/hr"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(6+S)/(6-S) = 3/1 => 6+S = 18-3S => 4S=12 => S=3.",
      "hash": "fc9dd4b299b7e47a",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक नाव शांत जल में 6 किमी/घंटा की गति से चलती है। धारा के प्रतिकूल जाने में उसे धारा के अनुकूल जाने की तुलना में तीन गुना समय लगता है। धारा की गति ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "3 किमी/घंटा",
            "B": "2 किमी/घंटा",
            "C": "4 किमी/घंटा",
            "D": "2.5 किमी/घंटा"
          },
          "explanation": "(6+S)/(6-S) = 3/1. 6+S = 18-3S. 4S = 12. S = 3."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-02-014",
      "number": 14,
      "question": "A solid metal sphere of radius 8 cm is melted to form 64 equal small spheres. What is the surface area of a small sphere?",
      "options": {
        "A": "16π",
        "B": "4π",
        "C": "8π",
        "D": "12π"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Volume equating: 512 = 64r³ => r=2. SA = 4πr² = 16π.",
      "hash": "c1873adb44054c7c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "8 सेमी त्रिज्या वाले एक ठोस धातु के गोले को पिघलाकर 64 समान छोटे गोले बनाए जाते हैं। छोटे गोले का पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "16π",
            "B": "4π",
            "C": "8π",
            "D": "12π"
          },
          "explanation": "आयतन बराबर: (4/3)π(8)³ = 64 × (4/3)πr³. 512 = 64r³. r³ = 8, r = 2. SA = 4π(2)² = 16π."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-02-015",
      "number": 15,
      "question": "Card drawn from 52. Probability it is neither a Spade nor a King?",
      "options": {
        "A": "9/13",
        "B": "10/13",
        "C": "3/4",
        "D": "7/13"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Spades=13. Other Kings=3. Total excluded=16. Favorable=36. Prob=36/52=9/13.",
      "hash": "6a2ed20bf4f584f0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "52 ताश के पत्तों की गड्डी से एक पत्ता निकाला जाता है। इसके न तो हुकुम (Spade) और न ही बादशाह (King) होने की प्रायिकता क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "9/13",
            "B": "10/13",
            "C": "3/4",
            "D": "7/13"
          },
          "explanation": "हुकुम = 13। अन्य बादशाह = 3। कुल बाहर किए गए = 16। अनुकूल = 52 - 16 = 36। प्रायिकता = 36/52 = 9/13।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-02-016",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "Parallel sides of a trapezium are 20cm and 10cm, non-parallel sides are equal to 13cm each. Find area.",
      "options": {
        "A": "180 cm²",
        "B": "120 cm²",
        "C": "150 cm²",
        "D": "100 cm²"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Height via Pythagoras: √(13²-5²) = 12. Area = 0.5(20+10)*12 = 180.",
      "hash": "1fa701e3f7259ac1",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक समलंब चतुर्भुज (Trapezium) की समांतर भुजाएँ 20 सेमी और 10 सेमी हैं और इसकी असमांतर भुजाएँ प्रत्येक 13 सेमी हैं। इसका क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिये।",
          "options": {
            "A": "180 सेमी²",
            "B": "120 सेमी²",
            "C": "150 सेमी²",
            "D": "100 सेमी²"
          },
          "explanation": "ऊंचाई निकालें। आधार में अंतर = 10। दोनों तरफ 5-5 का आधार बनेगा (त्रिभुज में)। कर्ण 13, आधार 5, तो ऊंचाई = 12। क्षेत्रफल = 1/2(20+10)×12 = 15 × 12 = 180."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-02-017",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "If number 42573* is divisible by 72, what is the minimum digit at *?",
      "options": {
        "A": "6",
        "B": "4",
        "C": "8",
        "D": "2"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Divisible by 8: 73* -> 736 is div by 8. So *=6. Sum=27 (div by 9). Correct.",
      "hash": "a4a5c1252e2e8a79",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि संख्या 42573* 72 से पूर्णतः विभाज्य है, तो * के स्थान पर न्यूनतम अंक क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "6",
            "B": "4",
            "C": "8",
            "D": "2"
          },
          "explanation": "72 = 8 × 9. 8 से विभाज्यता: 73* को 8 से कटना चाहिए। 736, 8 से विभाज्य है (92 बार)। अतः * = 6। 9 से जाँच: 4+2+5+7+3+6 = 27 (विभाज्य है)। सही।"
        }
      }
    },
